            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[Choose what the notch tells you

- Notify me about in Settings: switch off Finished, Needs your OK, Asked you something, Has a plan or Stopped on an error
- Switching one off only quiets the notch: the list, the cards and the status rings still show everything
- Each setting has a small icon, so the rows are easier to tell apart
- A new release is offered at once, with no wait
]]></description>
